FRONTEND/STREAMLIT_APP.PY
--------------------------
This is the Streamlit web application that provides the user interface.

Key Components:

1. Configuration:
   - API_BASE: Hardcoded backend URL (https://medisage-51pi.onrender.com)
   - Page config: Sets title and icon
   - Session state: Maintains chat history across interactions

