   - Shows all previous questions and answers
   - Displays in reverse order (newest first)
   - Uses Streamlit's chat_message component for better UI
   - Different styling for user vs AI messages

Session State:
- chat_history: List of tuples (speaker, message)
- Persists across interactions in the same session
- Cleared when new PDF is uploaded

