TECHNICAL STACK DETAILS
================================================================================

Backend Technologies:
---------------------
1. FastAPI: Modern Python web framework for building APIs
   - Fast, async-capable
   - Automatic API documentation
   - Type validation

2. Uvicorn: ASGI server to run FastAPI
   - Handles HTTP requests
   - Supports async operations

3. PyPDF2: PDF parsing library
   - Extracts text from PDF files
   - Simple but effective for text-based PDFs

4. LangChain: Framework for LLM applications
   - Provides abstractions for embeddings, vector stores, document loaders
   - Integrates with multiple providers (Google, OpenAI, etc.)

5. FAISS (Facebook AI Similarity Search): Vector database
   - Efficient similarity search
   - Handles large-scale vector operations
   - CPU version used (faiss-cpu)

6. Google Generative AI: LLM provider
   - Gemini 1.5 Flash: Fast, efficient model for responses
   - Embedding-001: Model for text-to-vector conversion

Frontend Technologies:
----------------------
1. Streamlit: Python-based web framework
   - Rapid UI development
   - Built-in widgets and components
   - No HTML/CSS/JavaScript needed

2. Requests: HTTP library
   - Sends API requests to backend
   - Handles file uploads and query parameters

